* The SN74HCS165 as its inputs and its supply (tools/sim.py fills the double-braced
* names from sims.yaml): each input is its capacitance and its leakage to ground,
* whose sign is a corner; VCC draws its static current. The register's thresholds are
* applied as measures, as the datasheet gives them. Its outputs are not modelled.
.subckt hcs165_inputs vcc gnd a b c d e f g h ser clk shld clkinh
IQ vcc gnd {{icc}}
CA a gnd {{ci}}
IA a gnd {{ileak}}
CB b gnd {{ci}}
IB b gnd {{ileak}}
CC c gnd {{ci}}
IC c gnd {{ileak}}
CD d gnd {{ci}}
ID d gnd {{ileak}}
CE e gnd {{ci}}
IE e gnd {{ileak}}
CF f gnd {{ci}}
IF f gnd {{ileak}}
CG g gnd {{ci}}
IG g gnd {{ileak}}
CH h gnd {{ci}}
IH h gnd {{ileak}}
CSER ser gnd {{ci}}
ISER ser gnd {{ileak}}
CCLK clk gnd {{ci}}
ICLK clk gnd {{ileak}}
CSHLD shld gnd {{ci}}
ISHLD shld gnd {{ileak}}
CINH clkinh gnd {{ci}}
IINH clkinh gnd {{ileak}}
.ends
